TITLE q1 calcite kinetics, SI(Witherite) step 10 vs 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    Cl   30
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10.0
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel_q1.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step time_s SI_Witherite
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TOTAL_TIME, SI("Witherite")
END
